   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Identify the principal driving movement in diffusion, such as depicted here. \n<img src=\"exercises/media/fa89a95055502430.png\" alt=\"The left part of this illustration shows a substance on one side of a membrane only, in the extracellular fluid. The middle part shows that, after some time, some of the substance has diffused across the plasma membrane, from the extracellular fluid and into the cytoplasm. The right part shows that, after more time, an equal amount of the substance is on each side of the membrane.\">",
   "answers": [
    {
